# Every text file is checked out with LF on every platform: guards read sources line by line, and a CRLF shebang
# makes a hook fail on Linux and macOS. Windows clones with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise write CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
githooks/* text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.tgz binary
